{"id":2774430634517288,"intent":"This context covers the wiring layer that turns process-level options into a running PDS instance in hono-pds: it owns keypair import or generation, Deno KV storage creation, parsing and normalisation of the did-web-services JSON and crawler list, and the createRepoFactory call that assembles the repository factory. It exists so the configuration surface (CreateFromEnvOptions) and the server lifecycle (StartOptions / StartResult, the start helper) can be exercised directly in tests and embedded by other launchers such as the worker-launcher script, without going through a CLI flag parser.","label":"SpecContext","name":"hono-pds","repo":"hono-pds","scope":"","specHash":"5716062719496b187f4382f6fcffe4e96ad8185faa19097223c9bdaa8bf7a9ff"}
